00:19:52.350 --> 00:19:55.270
Grave men near death, who see with blinding light,

512
00:19:55.590 --> 00:19:57.810
blind eyes could blaze like meteors and gay.

513
00:19:58.070 --> 00:19:59.670
Rage against the dying of the light.

514
00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.050
And you, my father, there in the sad height,

515
00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:05.450
curse, bless me now with your fierce tears, I pray.

